{"id":"d5973f7e2f1dfa48","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_S531Sat.md","title":"S531Sat","display":"S531Sat","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"S531Sat","parameters":["w","r","v","x","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"S531Sat"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>w</span><span>r</span><span>v</span><span>x</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：编号入口固定参数。有序参数：<code>w</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>v</code>、<code>x</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>固定入口参数；其余参数沿被调用定义的顺序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ S531Sat w r v x a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists e (and (@ Flags531 e) (@ MSat e w r v x a)))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e99ec5703bf63bf6\" href=\"?note=e99ec5703bf63bf6\" title=\"ZFC_Flags531\">Flags531</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e4fcc9b2d511fa9\" href=\"?note=4e4fcc9b2d511fa9\" title=\"ZFC_MSat\">MSat</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ S531Sat w r v x a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Flags531","status":"resolved","id":"e99ec5703bf63bf6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Flags531|Flags531]]；[[ZFC_MSat|MSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_MSat","status":"resolved","id":"4e4fcc9b2d511fa9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Flags531|Flags531]]；[[ZFC_MSat|MSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":818,"backlinks":[{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-922","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_S531Sat|S531Sat]]"},{"id":"45acb36ea7d665ef","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_S531Sat|S531Sat]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","e99ec5703bf63bf6","4e4fcc9b2d511fa9","593f9bdab4d60707"]}